From: sbe1v1k 25.12-6.18 port <noreply@sbe1v1k-build>
Subject: [PATCH] qca-nss-ppe: use timer_container_of() instead of from_timer()

6.16 removed from_timer(); timer.h now provides timer_container_of()
with the same argument order. ppe_qdisc_stats.c is the only user in
qca-nss-ppe.

Classification: portability (kernel API, no behaviour change).
--- a/drv/ppe_qdisc/ppe_qdisc_stats.c
+++ b/drv/ppe_qdisc/ppe_qdisc_stats.c
@@ -79,7 +79,7 @@
 	/*
 	 * Invoked by timer to begin a new stats fetch
 	 */
-	struct ppe_qdisc_stats_wq *pqsw = from_timer(pqsw, tm, stats_get_timer);
+	struct ppe_qdisc_stats_wq *pqsw = timer_container_of(pqsw, tm, stats_get_timer);
 	struct ppe_qdisc *pq = pqsw->pq;
 
 	ppe_qdisc_stats_queue_delayed_work(pq);
